#: addons/bbcs-xmlrpc-tunnel/views/settings.php:76
msgid "One IP or CIDR range per line. Supports: single IPs (192.168.1.1), CIDR (10.0.0.0/24), wildcards (192.168.*.*), IPv6 (::1, 2001:db8::/32). Lines starting with # are comments."
msgstr "Um IP ou intervalo CIDR por linha. Suporta: IPs individuais (192.168.1.1), CIDR (10.0.0.0/24), wildcards (192.168.*.*), IPv6 (::1, 2001:db8::/32). Linhas que começam com # são comentários."

#: includes/inc-botblocker-wp-abilities.php:93
